Accordingly, it is directed that applicant Neelesh Kushwah shall be released on bail in relation to Crime No.47 of 2024 registered at Police Station Kurwai, District Vidisha (M.P.) for offence punishable under Sections 363, 366, 376(2) of IPC and Sections 5L/6 of POCSO Act upon furnishing a personal bond in the sum of Rs. 50,000/- (Rs. Fifty Thousand Only) with one solvent surety of the same amount to the satisfaction of the Trial Court, for compliance with the following conditions,:
(For the sake of convenience of understanding by accused and surety, the conditions of bail are also reproduced in Hindi as under):-
(1) Applicant shall remain present on every date of hearing as may be directed by the concerned court;
